    "story": {
      "title": "Our Story",
      "p1": "HomeEase was founded in 2018 with a simple mission: to make professional home services accessible, reliable, and stress-free for everyone. We saw how difficult it was for homeowners to find trustworthy service providers, and we knew there had to be a better way.",
      "p2": "What started as a small team in San Francisco has grown into a nationwide network of vetted professionals serving thousands of homes every day. We've built our reputation on trust, quality, and exceptional customer service.",
      "p3": "Today, HomeEase connects homeowners with top-rated experts in cleaning, plumbing, electrical work, and more. Every professional on our platform is thoroughly vetted, background-checked, and committed to delivering outstanding service."
    },

